This product includes, in lean/vendor/rudich-factoring/, a part of the Lean 4 development
"Subexponential Deterministic Factoring" by Isaac Rudich and Louis-Martin Rousseau
(https://github.com/IsaacRudich/SubexponentialDeterministicFactoring, commit
c91cc3f4947caca8977e81a5d14244f73b5ae2b1), released under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(lean/vendor/rudich-factoring/LICENSE). Only the files needed by this product are included. The
Lean files are unmodified; lakefile.toml was modified to build only the included files, as stated
at the top of that file.

The script .github/scripts/comparator-check.sh is copied unmodified, and the workflow
.github/workflows/lean.yml is adapted, from anthropics/formal-math
(https://github.com/anthropics/formal-math), released under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This product depends on, but does not include, Lean 4 (https://github.com/leanprover/lean4) and
mathlib4 with its standard dependency set, fetched by the build tool at the revisions pinned in
lean/lake-manifest.json. Lean 4, mathlib4, batteries, aesop, Qq, ProofWidgets4, import-graph,
LeanSearchClient and plausible are released under the Apache License, Version 2.0; Cli
(leanprover/lean4-cli) is released under the MIT License.
